<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!-- Settlers on their way to found a hamlet under the colony's protection (Source/ColonyCouncil/World/Region/
       HamletEscort.cs). They never come on their own (weight 0): taken under the colony's protection, they camp by it
       with their families, carts and pack beasts until a caravan of the colony's sets out for the place of their hamlet,
       and go with it (or set off alone). Their coming and going are told by the hamlet's own words; these lines are
       their camp's while it stands. -->

  <ColonyCouncil.CampKindDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Camp_Settlers</defName>
    <label>settlers</label>
    <weight>0</weight>
    <people>2~8</people>
    <days>6~6</days>
    <ages>16~60</ages>
    <family>true</family>
    <huntsPerDay>0.2</huntsPerDay>
    <chopsPerDay>0.5</chopsPerDay>
    <hireChance>0</hireChance>
    <joinChance>0</joinChance>
    <helpChance>0.1</helpChance>
    <help>
      <li>wood</li>
    </help>
    <buys>
      <li>Meal</li>
      <li>RawFood</li>
      <li>Metal</li>
      <li>Textiles</li>
    </buys>
    <pride>0.1</pride>
    <breakTerms>0.02</breakTerms>
    <tensionPerDay>0.3</tensionPerDay>
    <canPay>false</canPay>
    <extendChance>0</extendChance>
    <structures>
      <li><role>fire</role><defs><li>Campfire</li></defs></li>
      <li><role>bed</role><defs><li>Bedroll</li><li>SleepingSpot</li></defs><stuff><li>Cloth</li><li>Leather_Plain</li></stuff></li>
      <li><role>wall</role><defs><li>DankPyon_TentWall</li><li>Wall</li></defs><stuff><li>Cloth</li><li>WoodLog</li></stuff><count>4</count></li>
    </structures>
    <!-- Their carts' beasts, tethered by the stash, and the timber and seed for their first houses and fields. -->
    <animals>
      <li><pack>true</pack><kinds><li>Muffalo</li><li>Donkey</li><li>Dromedary</li><li>Yak</li></kinds><count>1~2</count><at>picket</at></li>
    </animals>
    <campGoods>
      <li><defs><li>WoodLog</li></defs><count>25~40</count><at>picket</at></li>
      <li><defs><li>@Produce</li><li>RawPotatoes</li><li>RawCorn</li></defs><count>15~25</count><at>picket</at></li>
    </campGoods>
    <titles>
      <li>Settlers at the gate</li>
    </titles>
    <texts>
      <li>The settlers of {FACTION} have come in with their carts, and {X_nameDef} asked {A_nameDef} where they might wait {PLACE} until the colony's caravan sets out.</li>
      <li>[lowtech] Two carts piled with bedding, seed and a plough came up the track, and the settlers of {FACTION} behind them. {X_nameDef} told {A_nameDef} they would wait {PLACE} for the colony's caravan.</li>
    </texts>
    <settled>
      <li>The settlers from {FACTION} have their carts drawn up {PLACE}, the beasts tethered and the fire lit, ready to go the moment the colony's caravan does.</li>
      <li>The settlers' camp {PLACE} is half packed already: they unloaded only what they need for a few nights, and {X_nameDef} keeps looking down the road.</li>
    </settled>
    <farewell>
      <li>The settlers from {FACTION} loaded their carts and left their camp {PLACE}.</li>
    </farewell>
    <lines>
      <li>Is the caravan ready yet?</li>
      <li>Keep the seed dry.</li>
      <li>Our own roof, by summer.</li>
      <li>Check the cart wheels again.</li>
      <li>The children won't sleep, they're too excited.</li>
      <li>We'll have a field turned in a week.</li>
      <li>Don't unpack more than you need.</li>
      <li>I hope the soil's as good as they say.</li>
    </lines>
  </ColonyCouncil.CampKindDef>

</Defs>
